<title>USA: Morgan Stanley Dean Witter Q2 EPS $0.83 vs $0.90.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley Dean Witter Q2 EPS $0.83 vs $0.90.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Dean Witter Discover &amp; Co on Wednesday reported earnings of $0.83 a share for the second quarter ended May 31, including a special charge, compared with $0.90 a year earlier.</p>
<p>The company reported a special charge of $63 million, or $0.11 per share, from merger and restructuring expenses.</p>
<p>Including those charges, net income dropped to $509 million for the quarter from $551 million pro forma a year earlier.</p>
</text>
